{"suttaId":"thag10.5","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Th","vriCode":"s0508m.mul","paras":[2378,2408],"vripara":"567"},"segments":{"thag10.5:0.4":"Kappattheragāthā","thag10.5:1.1":"“Nānākulamalasampuṇṇo, mahāukkārasambhavo;","thag10.5:1.3":"Candanikaṃva paripakkaṃ, mahāgaṇḍo mahāvaṇo.","thag10.5:2.1":"“Pubbaruhirasampuṇṇo, gūthakūpena gāḷhito [gūthakūpe nigāḷhito (syā. pī. ka.)];","thag10.5:2.3":"Āpopaggharaṇo kāyo, sadā sandati pūtikaṃ.","thag10.5:3.1":"“Saṭṭhikaṇḍarasambandho, maṃsalepanalepito;","thag10.5:3.3":"Cammakañcukasannaddho, pūtikāyo niratthako.","thag10.5:4.1":"“Aṭṭhisaṅghātaghaṭito, nhārusuttanibandhano;","thag10.5:4.3":"Nekesaṃ saṃgatībhāvā, kappeti iriyāpathaṃ.","thag10.5:5.1":"“Dhuvappayāto maraṇāya, maccurājassa santike;","thag10.5:5.3":"Idheva chaḍḍayitvāna, yenakāmaṅgamo naro.","thag10.5:6.1":"“Avijjāya nivuto kāyo, catuganthena ganthito;","thag10.5:6.3":"Oghasaṃsīdano kāyo, anusayajālamotthato.","thag10.5:7.1":"“Pañcanīvaraṇe yutto, vitakkena samappito;","thag10.5:7.3":"Taṇhāmūlenānugato, mohacchādanachādito.","thag10.5:8.1":"“Evāyaṃ vattate kāyo, kammayantena yantito;","thag10.5:8.3":"Sampatti ca vipatyantā, nānābhāvo vipajjati.","thag10.5:9.1":"“Yemaṃ kāyaṃ mamāyanti, andhabālā puthujjanā;","thag10.5:9.3":"Vaḍḍhenti kaṭasiṃ ghoraṃ, ādiyanti punabbhavaṃ.","thag10.5:10.1":"“Yemaṃ kāyaṃ vivajjenti, gūthalittaṃva pannagaṃ;","thag10.5:10.3":"Bhavamūlaṃ vamitvāna, parinibbissantināsavā”ti [parinibbantunāsavā (sī.)].","thag10.5:10.5":"… Kappo thero …."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
